The context specifies that Safeguard 4.3 is "Configure automatic session locking on enterprise assets." According to the description provided in the context, for general purpose operating systems, the period of inactivity before automatic session locking must not exceed 15 minutes. For mobile end-user devices, the period must not exceed 2 minutes.

